p to 120 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"earthbind","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 flying creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gPvtmKMRpg9I9D7H","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"C9XoA5S47Kze6Mh6","name":"Earthbind","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/earthbind.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Using the weight of earth, you hamper a target's flight, with effects based on its Fortitude save. If the creature reaches the ground safely, it doesn't take falling damage.</p>\n<hr /><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target falls safely up to 120 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"earthbind","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 flying creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gPvtmKMRpg9I9D7H","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"LcZ516mwWvPsqlBk","name":"Neutralize Poison","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/neutralize-poison.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You pour healing magic through the target in an attempt to cure one poison afflicting it. Attempt a counteract check against the poison.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"neutralize-poison","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","healing","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":true},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SUKaxVZW2TlM8lu0","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"gGAShT3LAkd20nDX","name":"Vomit Swarm","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/vomit-swarm.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You belch forth a swarm of magical vermin. You evoke and shape the creatures from your own imagination, allowing you to change the appearance of the creatures (typically a mix of centipedes, roaches, wasps, and worms), but this doesn't change the effect of the spell. The vermin swarm over anyone in the area, their bites and stings dealing [[/r 2d8 #piercing]]{2d8 piercing damage} (basic Reflex save). A creature that fails its saving throw also becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. Once the spell ends, the swarm disappears.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by [[/r 1d8 #piercing]]{1d8 piercing}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"vomit-swarm","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Advanced Player's Guide","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"value":30,"type":"cone"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"formula":"2d8","type":"piercing","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"0":"1d8"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.cB17yFc9456Pyfec","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"5dHg8KjMqhnkjJtx","name":"Entangle","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/entangle.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Plants in the area entangle creatures. The area counts as difficult terrain. Each round that a creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure, it is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round. Creatures can attempt to Escape at entangle's DC to remove these effects.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"entangle","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","plant"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"value":20,"type":"burst","details":"all squares in a 20-foot-radius burst that contain plants"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J6vNvrUT3b1hx2iA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"D1ZFnrEh32PfoeZH","name":"Entangle","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/entangle.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Plants in the area entangle creatures. The area counts as difficult terrain. Each round that a creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure, it is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round. Creatures can attempt to Escape at entangle's DC to remove these effects.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"entangle","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","plant"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"value":20,"type":"burst","details":"all squares in a 20-foot-radius burst that contain plants"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J6vNvrUT3b1hx2iA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"5LtjsH3yQLnyuo2W","name":"Tree Shape","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tree-shape.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You transform into a Large tree. Perception checks don't reveal your true nature, but a successful Nature or Survival check against your spell DC reveals that you appear to be a tree that is strangely new to the area. While in tree form, you can observe everything around you, but you can't act other than to end the spell, and your turn, by using a single action, which has the concentrate trait. As a tree, your AC is 20, and only status bonuses, status penalties, circumstance bonuses, and circumstance penalties affect you. Any successes and critical successes you roll on Reflex saves are failures.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tree-shape","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","plant","polymorph"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"8 hours","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.dileJ0Yxqg76LMvu","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"MQvvQsBpKvPbV4Gh","name":"Dancing Lights","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dancing-lights.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create up to four floating lights, no two of which are more than 10 feet apart. Each sheds light like a torch. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move any number of lights up to 60 feet. Each light must remain within 120 feet of you and within 10 feet of all others, or it winks out.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dancing-lights","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kl2q6JvBZwed4B6v","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"N8FxpNNcrxIq3mDs","name":"Detect Magic","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.</p>\n<p>You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower level than the level of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an invisibility potion) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the school of magic for the highest-level effect within range that the spell detects. If multiple effects are equally strong, the GM determines which you learn.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd level, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-level magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"value":30,"type":"emanation"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"YPgIXbx1HWqJo3Rc","name":"Tanglefoot","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/tanglefoot.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A vine covered in sticky sap appears from thin air, flicking from your hand and lashing itself to the target. Attempt a spell attack against the target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target gains the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} condition and takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty and the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty.</p>\n<p>@Compendium[pf2e.spell-effects.TwtUIEyenrtAbeiX]{Spell Effect: Tanglefoot}</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The effects last for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The effects last for 1 minute.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"tanglefoot","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","concentrate","manipulate","plant"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.uZK2BYzPnxUBnDjr","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"P8chiQRU7M8eIty9","name":"Stabilize","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/stabelize.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Positive energy shuts death's door. The target loses the @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.yZRUzMqrMmfLu0V1]{Dying} condition, though it remains @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fBnFDH2MTzgFijKf]{Unconscious} at 0 Hit Points.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"stabilize","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","healing","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 dying creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"fcn02qL33ppsJqXR"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.SnjhtQYexDtNDdEg","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"I7SmedHCFTcoRuPx","name":"Branch Casting","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The eeko doesn't need to fulfill the verbal spell components of its innate primal spells, allowing it to cast its spells silently.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"O6eBWe1kTkkDp276","name":"Swarming Stings","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The swarm from the eeko's Unleash Hive ability is active;</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Each enemy in the eeko's swarm's space takes [[/r 2d8[piercing]]] damage (@Check[type:reflex|dc:25|name:Swarming Stings DC|traits:damaging-effect|showDC:gm]{basic Reflex} save) and is exposed to eeko bee venom. A successful save negates the poison exposure.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Eeko Bee Venom</strong> (poison);</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:25|name:Eeko Bee Venom DC|traits:poison|showDC:gm]{Fortitude};</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds;</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> [[/r 1d6[poison]]] (1 round);</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> [[/r 2d6[poison]]] and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} (2 rounds)</p>\n"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Gdryoh8Mufzc1TG2","name":"Unleash Hive","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute;</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The eeko releases a flurry of biting bees from its heart, creating a Huge swarm centered on the eeko. The swarm stays centered on the eeko and moves with the eeko.</p>\n<p>The swarm remains active for 1 minute or until the eeko takes at least 20 fire damage in the same round from a single attack or effect, whichever comes first.</p>\n<p>As long as the swarm is active, the eeko gains the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>@Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.9qV49KjZujZnSp6w]{All-Around Vision}</li>\n<li>@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealment}</li>\n<li>@Compendium[pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.fJSNOw4zHGbIm4bZ]{Fast Healing 3}</li>\n<li>Swarming Stings</li>\n</ul>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["primal"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"ldigRFmLUDwvP1vo":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":120,"temp":0,"max":120,"details":""},"ac":{"value":23,"details":"","base":23},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":25,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"swarm-mind"}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"axe-vulnerability","value":5},{"type":"cold-iron","value":5},{"type":"fire","value":5}],"resistances":[{"type":"bludgeoning","value":5},{"type":"piercing","value":5}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","fey"],"details":"can't speak (uses sign language only)"},"level":{"value":6},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Eekos are squat living bushes that grow around a primordial golden beehive from the fey realm. Many mistake the plant matter itself for the eeko, but the honeycomb \"heart\" and its constituent bees are the real animating force of this benevolent fey.</p>\n<p>Eekos prefer to live in forest groves and sun-dappled woodlands, where they mingle with other fey and occasionally help guide wayward travelers and animals, only attacking if they or their home are threatened. To eekos, nature is sacred, and most see themselves as stewards of the natural cycles of birth and death, feast and famine, renewal and decay. Most eekos are brave in a fight, sometimes recklessly so, and see adventure around every trunk.</p>\n<p>Although they harbor no love for humans or other creatures that often despoil wilderness in the name of \"civilization,\" eekos do enjoy the company of druids, especially vagabonds with stories of far-off places and unusual animals. Eekos cannot speak, but they love the sounds that voices can make, and they're happy to offer aid in exchange for stories and songs-even bad ones. Arboreals tend to be too plodding or methodical to maintain an eeko's attention, though the two creatures gladly work together to defend their shared homes from invaders.</p>\n<h2>Eeko Hearts</h2>\n<p>The golden heart of an eeko is no mere honeycomb-it is the essence of life itself. A destroyed eeko's heart provides enough nourishment to feed 30 Medium creatures for a day (or 15 Medium creatures for 2 days, and so forth). After 1 week, the heart dissolves and turns into just a handful of nonmagical pollen.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Eeko Creature 6 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 30/65/125 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing, slashing), armor (light), shield, skill items (Acrobatics, Medicine, Nature, Stealth, Survival)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, chaotic, constitution, dexterity, energy resistant (positive), good, poison, sensory (low-light vision), spells (Primal: dancing lights, detect magic, earthbind, entangle, neutralize poison, stabilize, tanglefoot, tree shape, vomit swarm), sturdy, wild, wisdom</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"Derrick Ferry","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":2},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":2},"wis":{"mod":5},"cha":{"mod":3}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":17,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":15,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":14},"medicine":{"base":15},"nature":{"base":17},"stealth":{"base":14},"survival":{"base":15}},"traits":{"value":["chaotic","fey","good","plant"],"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"sm"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"prototypeToken":{"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":1,"width":1,"disposition":-1,"name":"Eeko","actorLink":false,"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"bar2":{"attribute":null},"randomImg":false,"light":{"alpha":0.25,"angle":360,"bright":0,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"speed":5,"intensity":5,"type":null,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"attenuation":0.5,"color":null,"negative":false,"priority":0},"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/Tokens/eeko.webp